<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-20T01:57:05.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-img-link-explain-9d3d3213-ebc7-413a-b0bd-cca69ed0a6cf",
        "text": "Pictures make web pages much more exciting! We use the `<img>` tag to embed an image into our HTML. It's like adding a photo to a digital scrapbook!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b028453cb0126c5ed7d2f7a4df34a296-test-lesson-img-link-explain-panel-1-9d34cead-6564-4439-b2e1-462fb9d49146.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-img-link-explain-226a26e8-c273-479e-bfbf-48c877ad227a",
        "text": "But how does the computer know *which* image to show? That's where the `src` attribute comes in. It tells the browser the image's source, or where to find it. The `alt` attribute describes the image for accessibility, which is super important for everyone!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/dc657c6332abc9b03e493f7ba55b36dc-test-lesson-img-link-explain-panel-2-30b60c32-8244-48ed-a407-5d6af1b95211.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-img-link-explain-a0002e70-b55c-4d9f-b69d-ed31efd48e68",
        "text": "Webpages aren't just static content; they're *connected*! We use the `<a>` (anchor) tag to create hyperlinks, letting users jump to other pages or even different parts of the same page.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f161cf14659ae439eb394e67d567d9ee-test-lesson-img-link-explain-panel-3-52646e5e-f8dd-4fd3-ac5b-041f08c28fbc.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-img-link-explain-99f8b233-dda4-4122-b307-eda339b9b0f1",
        "text": "The `href` attribute is key for links. It holds the destination URL – the address of where you want the link to go. The text *between* the `<a>` tags is what people actually click on!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8346cd3be15f2ef0a87b7f818a4f8861-test-lesson-img-link-explain-panel-4-2ca050b9-d1bb-449d-b1ea-567181f7e39b.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Explain how to embed images using the <img> tag, focusing on the 'src' and 'alt' attributes. Then, explain how to create hyperlinks using the <a> tag, highlighting the 'href' attribute for destination URLs and the display text. Use simple, relatable examples."
  },
  "published": true,
